  WORKER <-->|Claim lease · save results · index files| SQL
  WORKER <-->|Load and save page models| DERIVED
  WORKER <-->|Unix socket · bytes and pages| PARSER
  WORKER -.->|CTS lookups · optional event push| CTS
  WORKER -->|Page model| EXTRACT
